id: pm-ado-github-5532dc4b9a65-84
title: Release timeout asks for workflow approval after automatic approval succeeded
description: "GH issue #84: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ado/issues/84 · author @unbraind · created 2026-11-03T21:54:42Z · updated 2026-11-15T21:27:30Z"
